      "title": "Bypass tip",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "If DenoRTXVFXEasyUpscale errors (VFX missing):\n\n1. Mute/bypass node **2. RTX Deblur**\n2. Connect **GetVideoComponents.images → RIFE.frames**\n3. Still get 24→48fps smooth polish\n"
      ],
